{"displayStem":"성인의 척추관을 시상면에서 단순화한 그림이다. 뼈 높이의 숫자와 X 주변 구조의 상대 위치를 비교한다. 실제 MRI가 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 모식도 · 크기 비례 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"구조 관계를 단순화한 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"470\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"80\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">성인 · 시상면</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"75\" width=\"100\" height=\"42\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"135\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">T12</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"132\" width=\"100\" height=\"42\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"135\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">L1</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"189\" width=\"100\" height=\"42\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"135\" y=\"219\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">L2</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"246\" width=\"100\" height=\"42\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"135\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">L3</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"303\" width=\"100\" height=\"42\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"135\" y=\"333\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">L4</text><path d=\"M350 60V130L380 185L410 130V60\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"430\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"25\" style=\"font-size:25px\" fill=\"#111\">X</text><path d=\"M365 160L330 335M380 185V355M395 160L445 335M380 200L270 335M380 200L490 355\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"470\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">